c2patool-musl
=============

This repository redistributes unmodified upstream source code, compiled for a
target that the upstream project does not publish.

Upstream project: c2patool, part of c2pa-rs
Upstream source:  https://github.com/contentauth/c2pa-rs
Copyright:        2020 Adobe. All rights reserved.
License:          MIT OR Apache-2.0

This repository contains no upstream source code. Every release is compiled
from the upstream release tag named in that release, or from the matching
crates.io package. The source is never patched, vendored or modified. The only
change is the target triple. The published targets are
x86_64-unknown-linux-musl and aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.

Every release states the upstream tag it was built from, the compiler version
and the sha256 of every archive. Each release archive also contains a
MUSL-BUILD.txt file that repeats that information.

Each release archive keeps the files that upstream shipped in the same release,
with one change. The glibc binary is replaced by the musl binary.

The upstream license texts are in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE. The upstream
project is dual licensed. You can use it under either license. GitHub reports
the license of c2pa-rs as NOASSERTION, because GitHub cannot detect a dual
license.

This repository is not an official ContentAuth or Adobe distribution. Adobe and
ContentAuth do not produce, review, endorse or support these builds. No Adobe or
ContentAuth trademark or logo is used here.
